# Global overrides for gguf-launcher. Copy to gguf-launcher.args next to the exe
# and edit. One or more flags per line; lines starting with # are comments.

# Bind only to this machine (the launcher's first-launch default is 0.0.0.0)
# --host 127.0.0.1

# Smaller context for a small GPU
# -c 32768

# Keep the browser from opening
# --no-browser